@SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### =========================================================
### Categories CRUD
### =========================================================

### Categories: get all
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories

### Categories: get by id
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1

### Categories: create
# @name createCategory
POST {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Category",
  "description": "Created via .http sample request"
}

### Categories: get the just-created record
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.id}}

### Categories: update
PUT {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Category Updated",
  "description": "Updated via .http sample request"
}

### Categories: delete
DELETE {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.id}}

### Categories: confirm 404 after delete
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.id}}


### =========================================================
### Products CRUD
### =========================================================

### Products: get all
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products

### Products: get by id
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1

### Products: get by category
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/by-category/1

### Products: create
# @name createProduct
POST {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Product",
  "sku": "SKU-SAMPLE-001",
  "price": 99000,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Products: get the just-created record
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.id}}

### Products: update
PUT {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Product Updated",
  "sku": "SKU-SAMPLE-001-B",
  "price": 129000,
  "stockQuantity": 20,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Products: delete
DELETE {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.id}}

### Products: confirm 404 after delete
GET {{SalesInventory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.id}}
